<title>HONG KONG: Guangshen Railway declares 1st H1 results.</title>
<headline>Guangshen Railway declares 1st H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.16 yuan</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  N/A</p>
<p>    Net				510.15</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,065.75</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangshen Railway Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Guangshen Railway operates the sole railroad between Guangzhou and Shenzhen and participates in through-train services to Hong Kong. It was listed on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on May 14, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
